WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:21.624
"Honk! Honk!" called Goose.

2
00:00:21.625 --> 00:00:25.519
It was later that day.

3
00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:28.672
Goose landed in the park.

4
00:00:28.673 --> 00:00:34.031
"I'm here!" called Goose. "Honk!"

5
00:00:34.032 --> 00:00:41.550
Kip ran down the tree.

6
00:00:41.551 --> 00:00:50.491
"I'm glad you're here, Goose!" he said.

7
00:00:50.492 --> 00:00:54.109
Bird flew down.

8
00:00:54.110 --> 00:00:57.068
"I'm glad too!" she said.

9
00:00:57.069 --> 00:01:00.585
"We can do fun things," said Kip.

10
00:01:00.586 --> 00:01:03.585
"I made a list!" said Bird.

11
00:01:03.586 --> 00:01:07.637
"I made a list too," said Kip.

12
00:01:07.638 --> 00:01:10.652
Bird and Kip looked at each other.

13
00:01:10.653 --> 00:01:14.343
"You made a list?" they both said.

14
00:01:14.344 --> 00:01:19.521
"Well . . . ," said Bird.

15
00:01:19.522 --> 00:01:24.745
"I guess we can use both lists."

16
00:01:24.746 --> 00:01:28.392
"Good idea, Bird," said Kip.

17
00:01:28.393 --> 00:01:31.767
Kip looked at his list.

18
00:01:31.768 --> 00:01:35.629
"The playground is first," he said.

19
00:01:35.630 --> 00:01:38.238
"Let's go, Goose!"

20
00:01:38.239 --> 00:01:47.277
Kip started to walk.

21
00:01:47.278 --> 00:01:50.004
"Hmph!" said Bird.

22
00:01:50.005 --> 00:01:54.111
She looked at her list.

23
00:01:54.112 --> 00:01:58.217
"The beach is first," said Bird.

24
00:01:58.218 --> 00:02:09.536
"Let's go, Goose!"
